      <Ordine>20</Ordine>
      <Capitolo>Automatic transmission oil level check</Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;html xmlns:v=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml&quot; xmlns:o=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; xmlns:w=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word&quot; xmlns:m=&quot;http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/2004/12/omml&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40&quot;&gt;     &lt;body lang=IT style=&apos;tab-interval:35.4pt;word-wrap:break-word&apos;&gt;  &lt;div class=WordSection1&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;The oil level check of the automatic transmission should be carried out with the oil at room temperature and the engine cold&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Move the automatic transmission lever to position &lt;B&gt;(N)&lt;/B&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Using diagnostic equipment, depressurise the hydraulic actuation circuit&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Remove fuse &lt;B&gt;F83 &lt;/B&gt;(30 A) for the duration of the operation&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Check that the oil level in the actuator tank corresponds to the MAX marking on the tank&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Top up if necessary&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;The oil consumption of the robotized gearbox is very low. If the oil level is below the idle level, check for leaks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/body&gt;  &lt;/html&gt;</Corpo>
